        "chapter": "02 — Our promise",
        "heading": "Made to be <em>lived in</em>",
        "text": "<p>We design for real days: pockets that hold a phone, waistbands you can sit in, fabrics that soften instead of pilling.</p><p>If something does not work for you, send it back within 30 days — we will make it right.</p>",
